  "extraction_notes": "Miami-Dade publishes a combined Elementary/Secondary calendar PDF. Per the footnote on the calendar, 'Every Wednesday students in elementary schools (Grades 2-5) and K-8 Centers (Grades 2-8) are released one (1) hour early' \u2014 so every Wednesday between first and last day is classified as early_release for the elementary grade band. Teacher planning days marked 'available to opt' (Sep 23, Oct 2, Jan 16, Mar 20, Apr 3) and non-opt planning/PD days (Nov 3) are all teacher_only (no students in school). Winter recess = Dec 22, 2025 \u2013 Jan 2, 2026; Spring recess = Mar 23-27, 2026; both classified as break. Thanksgiving week: Nov 24-26 are Recess Days for 10-month/11.5-month employees only (students out of school) \u2014 classified as break since they are part of the Thanksgiving multi-day closure. Nov 27 Thanksgiving holiday and Nov 28 Recess Day grouped as part of Thanksgiving break week. Last day June 4 is also the first day of grade 5/5th grading period end; no half-day marking so left as full_instructional (except it is a Thursday, not Wednesday, so no early release). First day Aug 14 is a Thursday, full_instructional.",
